# Remnants — overview

Monorepo: `backend/` · `frontend/` · `packages/shared/` (API Zod/DTO).

Details: `layer-boundaries`, `backend-conventions`, `frontend-conventions`.

## IDs — NEVER ObjectId

Use string UUIDs for `_id` and refs (`*Id`, `*Ids`). Validate with `z.string().uuid()` / `idSchema`. Generate with `uuidv4` + `uuidValidator`. Legacy ObjectId only in `backend/src/migrations`.

```ts
// ✅
_id: { type: String, default: uuidv4, validate: uuidValidator }
currencyId: { type: String, ref: 'Currency', required: true }

// ❌
_id: { type: Schema.Types.ObjectId, auto: true }
```

## Folders

Backend flow: route → controller → service → mapper → repository → model  
(`routes/api`, `controllers`, `services`, `mappers`, `repositories`, `models`, `schemas`, `types`, `middleware`, `migrations`, `utils`, `test`)

Frontend: `app/` · `api/hooks/<entity>/` · `api/requests/` · `containers/` (`*Page` = index+context+components) · `components/` · `components/ui/` · `locales/en|ru` · `utils/`

New entity: shared → backend (model…route + test) → frontend (hooks + container + locales).
